    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No.12. Dowling Property is delighted to present to the market, this very impressive, 4 bedroomed spacious home. Presented in very good condition throughout, this superb 4 bedroom,  B energy rated home offers coastal living at its finest, located just a short walk from the Unesco Baldoyle Bay Promenade.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to c.154 sq.mt across 3 floors. The home enjoys a bright, airy aspect directly overlooking a mature green to front. Notable features include 2 en-suite bedrooms, utility, guest w.c., gas heating and outside decking. The standout feature is the large, penthouse style, master suite which occupies the entire top floor, featuring high ceilings and a southwest facing terrace overlooking the green and the Dublin Mountains.\r\n\r\nThe location is exceptional. Clongriffin and Bayside DART stations are within a short walk distance, providing fast access to Dublin City Centre, while Dublin airport is just a 15 minute drive away. There is also great access to the M1/M50 road network.\r\n\r\nBaldoyle boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School which is located just c.300 metres from your front door, along with a choice of primary/secondary schools, childcare facilities. Racecourse Community Centre, parks, playgrounds, shops and seafront are all within walk distance. \r\n\r\nWith is fantastic location, space, layout and B energy rating, we must advise on early viewings. A true gem!!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Baldoyle boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School which is located just c.300 metres from your front door, along with a choice of primary/secondary schools, childcare facilities. Racecourse Community Centre, parks, playgrounds, shops and seafront are all within walk distance. \r\n\r\nWith is fantastic location, space, layout and B energy rating, we must advise on early viewings. A true gem!!!\r\n\r\n1st Floor  - 3 generous sized bedrooms ( 2 Double and 1 Single) with en-suite and family bathroom.\r\n2nd Floor - The whole top floor is dedicated to an impressive master bedroom with spacious en-suite and a large private terrace with views over Howth Hill.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are located on your doorstep which includes a selection of both primary and secondary schools, childcare, shopping in the Racecourse Shopping Centre with Lidl, pharmacy and coffee/restaurant shop, etc. Baldoyle also boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School. There is a vast array of leisure activities and all just a short distance to the seafront."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 6.68m x 1.97m \r\nA spacious and welcoming hallway with wooden floor and cloak room.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.88m x 0.77m \r\nPlumbed for washing machine and storage area.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Breakfast Room - 5.76m x 2.84m \r\nThis light filled kitchen enjoys a very pleasant aspect overlooking a well kept green area. Stylish ivory fitted kitchen with built in gas hob and oven, integrated fridge/freezer and Bosch dishwasher and all complete with granite worktops. Porcelain tiled floor, feature bay window.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C - 2.14m x 1.51m \r\nGenerous sized guest w.c., with wash hand basin. Tiled floor and walls.\r\n\r\nSitting Room/Dining Room - 6.21m x 4.91m \r\nImpressive open-plan living space with two skylights, wooden flooring, an attractive fireplace with marble hearth and custom floor-to-ceiling oak shelving. French doors open directly onto the deck.\r\n\r\nDecking Area - 4.01m x 2.46m \r\nA very pleasant decking area which is private and not overlooked. Pedestrian gate to communal gardens and parking.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Landing Area - 4.01m x 2.17m \r\nGallery staircase, wooden floor, hotpress.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear) - 3.54m x 3.63m \r\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes. Wooden floor.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 3.63m x 1.24m \r\nGenerous sized en-suite with step in shower, tiled floor and walls. W.c. and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.3m x 1.85m \r\nAttractive floor and wall tiles, bath, w.c., and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front) - 4.37m x 2.65m \r\nThis very spacious double bedroom boasts a wonderful aspect overlooking the green area to front, through a feature bay window. Wooden floor, built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (Front) - 2.86m x 2.16m \r\nA generous sized single bedroom with wooden floor and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\n2nd Floor Master Bedroom Suite - 7.02m x 3.58m \r\nThis room is the star of the show as it extends the full space of the top floor. Built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.98m x 1.21m \r\nTiled floor, step in shower, w.c and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nTerrace - 4.86m x 2.17m \r\nA showstopping large terrace located off the master bedroom enjoying pleasant views over green area. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "High B3 Energy Rating\r\nOverlooks Green to Front\r\n2 En-Suite Bedroom\r\nMaster Bedroom Has Wonderful Terrace\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nLarge Sitting Room\r\nRear Decking Area\r\nGas Heating\r\nGood Decorative Order Throughout\r\nShort Walk to Dart Station\r\nQuiet Cul-De-Sac Location\r\nAccom Exts c.154 sq.mt\r\n2 Designated Secure Parking Spaces"
